Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢着  慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:05.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're telling me this actress person...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:05.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说这个女演员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:08.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is the only woman you ever wanted who didn't want you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:08.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是唯一一个对你的示爱毫无回应的女人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this what it's like to be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:13.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的人生就是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:18.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're crazy about her, huh? - You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:18.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你真的很喜欢她啊  -你都想象不出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:22.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When we're on stage, I get to kiss her and touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:22.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在台上时  我可以吻她摸她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She goes home with the director...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果她却跟导演回家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and it's like somebody's ripping out my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就心如刀割
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:29.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's so great to see you feeling like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:29.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看你这样感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica. Dad called this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  爸早上打电话来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:39.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aunt Sylvia passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:39.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}施薇亚姑姑过世了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:44.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!! Yes! Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:44.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好耶  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:49.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were all pretty shaken up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:49.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都很震惊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I missing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我漏听了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought death was supposed to be sad, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在某种程度上  死亡不是悲伤的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Aunt Sylvia was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}施薇亚姑姑...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:00:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... not a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:00:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是一个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:02.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was a cruel, cranky old bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:02.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是个残忍的糟老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm sorry she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很难过她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did Dad say I get the dollhouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸爸有没有说娃娃屋归我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You get the dollhouse. - I get the dollhouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-娃娃屋归你了  -我得到娃娃屋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A house for dolls! That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}娃娃住的屋子  好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was a kid, I had a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我小时候只有铁桶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Pheebs, you had a barrel for a dollhouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你拿铁桶当娃娃屋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, just a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  就是一个铁桶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:29.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? You can play with my dollhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:29.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以玩我的娃娃屋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:30.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:30.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any time you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随时欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was young I wanted to play with this dollhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我小时候总是渴望玩这个娃娃屋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:38.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But no! It was to be looked at,never played with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:38.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是不行  只准看不准玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:41.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My Grandmother used to say that exact same thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:41.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我奶奶以前也是这样告诫我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》第三季第二十集  娃娃屋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, Sophie!  - Hey, Rach!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-苏菲好啊  -你好  瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:37.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for lunch. Chandler. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:37.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你请我吃饭  钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:38.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't have to walk me all the way back up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:38.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不必这么麻烦  一路送我回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:41.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's okay. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:41.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事  不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:48.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey um, honey, you do realize that we don't keep the women's lingerie here in the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:48.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝贝  你知道我们不会把女性内衣放在办公室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Summer catalog. - That's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-夏季型录  -就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, I need the Versace invoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  给我范思哲的发货清单
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是我的员工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joanna, this is my friend Chandler Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔安娜  我的朋友钱德勒·宾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:05.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:05.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是乔安娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bing? That's a great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宾  很棒的姓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Gaelic for,"Thy turkey's done."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是盖尔语的"火鸡煮好了"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm gonna go. Nice meeting you. -You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我走了  幸会  -幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:17.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:17.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜拜  钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. He's just goofy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么  他都这样疯疯癫癫的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I actually hardly notice it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都没感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:32.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, is he married or involved with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:32.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说他已婚吗  有对象吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:36.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. He's not married or involved with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:36.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  他未婚  没有对象
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, actually, you know what? Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  这样吧  我看还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:45.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'll ask him for you, if you want. - Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:45.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-需要的话  我可以帮你探探口风  -真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or is it too sad and desperate, 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:47.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样会不会太可悲  太饥渴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you know, something Sophie would do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你懂的  就像苏菲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:52.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I am here. - I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:52.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我能听见  -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:56.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:56.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:04:01.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wallpaper's a little faded. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:04:01.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}壁纸有点褪色  没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Carpet's a little loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}地毯有点翘起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hardwood floors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}硬木地板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:13.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Monica, it's so beautiful! - I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:13.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莫妮卡  它真美啊  -可不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm here, ready to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来了  准备开玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:20.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I brought a bunch of stuff for the house, so check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:20.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我带了一堆东西放在屋子里  快看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a dog. Every house should have a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}狗狗  每栋房子都应该有只狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:31.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not one that can pee on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:31.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能大到可以在屋顶上撒尿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's so big because 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它这么大也许是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the house was built on radioactive waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为房子盖在辐射废料掩埋地上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And is this in case the house sneezes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是防止房子打喷嚏用的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's the ghost for the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  那是阁楼里的鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I don't want a ghost. - Well, nobody wants a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不要鬼  -谁都不想闹鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you've got one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是这里闹鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:05:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... because the house is sitting on an ancient lndian burial ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:05:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为房子盖在印地安古坟场上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:07.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. The house was built on radioactive waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:07.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢着  这栋房子盖在辐射废料掩埋地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and an ancient lndian burial ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和印地安古坟场上
