Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to take this call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要接个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:18.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I continue, I hope there will appear on-stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:18.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我回来  希望台上会出现...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this magical thing that in the theater we call...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一种神奇的东西  在戏剧界称之为...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:26.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...committing to the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:26.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"入戏"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guy's like a cartoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟卡通人物一样白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you see in him, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底看上他哪一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He happens to be brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他刚好很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:39.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which is more than I can say for that sweater you're dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:39.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比你那位毛衣女郎好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not interested in her sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是看上她的毛衣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:46.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's what's underneath her sweater that counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:46.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毛衣底下才重要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:54.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...since when do you care who I'm with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:54.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你几时开始关心我跟谁交往
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care. Why, do you want me to care?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不关心  怎么  你希望我关心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want me to want you to care?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你希望我希望你关心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:01.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:01.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呢
