Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我实在很不想说  不过我们继续排吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:18.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, baby, don't go. Please? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:18.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样  宝贝  不要走  求你了 
