Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:19.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got no reason to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有理由留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}停
