Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是烂演员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a terrible play!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是出烂戏
