Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:45.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe we go on in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:45.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信一星期后就要上台了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, it's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题的
