Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是我昨晚说的那个地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, with the mug-painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  那里可以画马克杯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:05.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was so listening to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:05.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听得很用心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:10.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you know what? I need to kind of work on my stuff tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:10.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你知道吗  我今晚想好好练戏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:13.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ok, I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:13.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  那明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:20.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. - Good night!
