Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:53.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须给她有力的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe he could slip her the tongue.
