Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者...
