Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可以捉住她  把她抱起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:13.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then Adrianne could wrap her legs around his waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:13.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后爱德莉安用腿圈住他的腰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then she could rip off his shirt 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}扯开他的衣服 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and kiss his chest and stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲吻他的胸部  肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then he could use his teeth, his teenth to undo her dress and...
