Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and bite her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后咬她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then right when the scene ends, he could take her...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在结尾的部份  他可以占有她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:29.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with this raw, animal....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:29.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用他那原始的  兽性的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's pretty much what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我想的差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:04.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a little early to be drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:04.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在喝酒太早了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:09.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, things finally happened with Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:09.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没醉  我跟凯特终于有进展了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  太好了
