Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:16.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After the lovemaking...
