Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:17.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:17.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:22.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... I just watched her sleep for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:22.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看着她睡觉看了好久
