Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:31.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的眼睛一直这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, Joanna's got it all wrong, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你说  乔安娜完全误会了  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I said was, "This was fun. Let's do it again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是说今晚很愉快  改天再聚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll give you a call."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:49.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wonder why she thinks you're going to call her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:49.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还想她为什么觉得你会打给她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:52.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's what you say at the end of a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:52.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}约完会都要这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't just say,"Nice to meet you. Good night?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就不能说  很高兴认识你  晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To her face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当着她的面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}lt's the end of the date. I'm standing there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}约会结束了  我站在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she's waiting for me to say I'll call her...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道她在等我这句话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and it comes out. I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我就说了  就这么脱口而出
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a compulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.81,0:15:09.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Rach, 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.81,0:15:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这么较真  瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:12.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When a guy says he'll call, it doesn't mean he's going to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:12.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男人说要联络  也不见得会联络
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This never happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没碰到过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, they always called.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们都会打给我
